        "original_id": "112e9ced-3c3c-573a-a0a0-32fbdddce4c5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ross Case, Slobodan Živojinović\n- Events: 1974 Pacific Coast Open, 1985 Australian Open, 1986 Wimbledon Championships\n- Roles: tennis players\n- Concepts: singles results, rankings, prize money\n\nFacts:\n- Ross Case was born on 1 November 1951 and is an Australian former tennis player.\n- At the 1974 Pacific Coast Open, unseeded Ross Case won the singles title, earned $16,000 in first-prize money, and received 80 Grand Prix points.\n- Slobodan Živojinović reached the singles semi-finals of the 1985 Australian Open.\n- Slobodan Živojinović reached the singles semi-finals of the 1986 Wimbledon Championships.\n- Slobodan Živojinović achieved a career-high singles ranking of World No. 19.",
